# short-description: Raspberry Pi 5 SD card with A/B slots for RAUC updates
# long-description: GPT. The firmware reads autoboot.txt from the first
# partition and boots slot A (partition 2) or B (partition 3); each slot's
# kernel command line names its root filesystem (4 or 5). The data partition
# survives updates. docs/adr/0008-ab-updates-with-rauc-and-tryboot.md has
# the design; system.conf (rauc-conf), edgenode-boot and edgenode-bootfs
# use the same partition numbers.
#
# Slot A gets this image's boot slot image and root filesystem with its
# dm-verity hash tree (edgenode-verity.bbclass), byte for byte what an update
# bundle carries. Slot B gets the same boot files and an empty file system:
# its command line names slot A's root hash, so booted by mistake it finds no
# valid root filesystem, panics and reboots into slot A. The root filesystem
# sizes leave room for growth.
#
# GPT types are explicit: wic gives a rawcopy partition without --fstype the
# FAT type.

part --source rawcopy --sourceparams="file=edgenode-autoboot-${MACHINE}.vfat" --ondisk mmcblk0 --part-name autoboot --part-type EBD0A0A2-B9E5-4433-87C0-68B6B72699C7 --align 4096 --fixed-size 16M
part --source rawcopy --sourceparams="file=${IMGDEPLOYDIR}/${IMAGE_LINK_NAME}.bootfs.vfat" --ondisk mmcblk0 --part-name bootA --part-type EBD0A0A2-B9E5-4433-87C0-68B6B72699C7 --align 4096 --fixed-size 128M
part --source rawcopy --sourceparams="file=${IMGDEPLOYDIR}/${IMAGE_LINK_NAME}.bootfs.vfat" --ondisk mmcblk0 --part-name bootB --part-type EBD0A0A2-B9E5-4433-87C0-68B6B72699C7 --align 4096 --fixed-size 128M
part --source rawcopy --sourceparams="file=${IMGDEPLOYDIR}/${IMAGE_LINK_NAME}.verity" --ondisk mmcblk0 --part-name rootA --part-type 0FC63DAF-8483-4772-8E79-3D69D8477DE4 --align 4096 --fixed-size 1024M
part --fstype=ext4 --label rootB --ondisk mmcblk0 --part-name rootB --part-type 0FC63DAF-8483-4772-8E79-3D69D8477DE4 --align 4096 --fixed-size 1024M
part --fstype=ext4 --label data --ondisk mmcblk0 --part-name data --part-type 0FC63DAF-8483-4772-8E79-3D69D8477DE4 --align 4096 --fixed-size 256M

bootloader --ptable gpt
